  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Us Cover the Gap!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us not to say NO to any child approaching the Children&apos;s Cancer Center of Lebanon for treatment. The battle is on so many fronts: the unavailability of medications, the devaluation of the Lebanese currency, the scarcity of foreign currency needed to secure medications and cover treatment, the decrease in value of third party guarantors&apos; share and several other hardships and challenges that the children living in Lebanon face along with their families.</narrative>
  </description>
